One detail worth flagging: the EA never retrains or refits either forecaster during a run - Model A's ONNX weights are frozen at export time, Model B's EMA parameters are fixed. This is non-negotiable for the DM test to mean anything: letting one model adapt mid-test contaminates the loss differential with a structural break the HAC estimator isn't designed to absorb.
